diff --git a/saas/README.md b/saas/README.md
index 28b0891..af5c14d 100644
--- a/saas/README.md
+++ b/saas/README.md
@@ -105,3 +105,18 @@ knife ssh 'hostname:fizzy-lb-*' 'sudo docker exec fizzy-load-balancer kamal-prox
 ## License
 
 fizzy-saas is released under the [O'Saasy License](LICENSE.md).
+
+## Billing
+
+Hosted Fizzy is on paid plans (see `saas/app/models/plan.rb` for the allowances and prices). Stripe hosts Checkout and the customer portal; Fizzy only redirects to them.
+
+Environment variables:
+
+* `STRIPE_SECRET_KEY`: API key for creating Checkout and portal sessions and cancelling subscriptions.
+* `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET`: signing secret for the endpoint below.
+* `STRIPE_MONTHLY_V1_PRICE_ID`: the Unlimited plan's price ($20/month).
+* `STRIPE_UNLIMITED_PLUS_PRICE_ID`: the Unlimited+ plan's price ($25/month). A plan whose price isn't set can't be bought.
+
+Subscription changes arrive at `POST /stripe/webhooks`. Fizzy handles `customer.subscription.created`, `customer.subscription.updated`, and `customer.subscription.deleted`, and matches the account by the `account_id` metadata set at Checkout. Events older than the last one applied are ignored.
+
+Support's tools are at `/admin/accounts`: comp an account (Unlimited allowances without a subscription), override its card count or bytes used, or reset those overrides.
